<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Khmer Seller Book</h1><p>Privacy policy placeholder for the planned Khmer Seller Book application.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Status: Pre-release draft</strong></p><p>This app is still in planning. The final privacy policy will be updated before public testing or release to match the actual app implementation, permissions, SDKs, analytics, advertising, cloud services, and data handling.</p><h2>Planned privacy direction</h2><p>The product is being designed to avoid collecting data that is not needed for its core functions. Seller, customer, order, and payment records will be documented clearly before release, including where data is stored and whether any third-party services receive it.</p><h2>Before release</h2><p>This page will be reviewed against the final Android build and Google Play Data safety disclosures. It should not be treated as the final production privacy policy until the app is released.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
